    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Verifies {@link MutableClock#add(java.time.temporal.TemporalAmount)}. <p> A {@code MutableClock} applies each {@code add} call by interpreting its instant as a {@link ZonedDateTime}, adding the amount, then converting back to an instant. This test applies a sequence of {@link Duration} and {@link Period} amounts (including positive, negative and zero values) and confirms the clock ends up at the instant produced by applying the same sequence to the starting date-time."
